The '''sarcophagus''' of Pharaoh [[Osmumten]] can be found in his burial chamber in the [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid. If any player in the raid has received a unique reward, the flames around the sarcophagus will glow purple instead of white, and can be opened by the player who received the unique.
[[File:Tombs of Amascut - receiving rare reward.gif|thumb|left|300px|A player receives the [[Masori body]] from Osmumten's sarcophagus.]]

